# 9. PARTY LEADER DEATH

If the Party Leader dies but other Heroes remain alive:

```text
LEADER DEAD
     ↓
PARTY STILL ACTIVE
     ↓
AI / PARTY SYSTEM
     ↓
NEW COMBAT LEADERSHIP LOGIC
```

The death of the Leader alone does **not automatically fail the mission**.

Possible behavior:

```text
Second-in-command assumes leadership
AI selects temporary combat leader
Another Hero takes tactical control
Party morale changes
Character emotions change
Formation changes
```

However, the Party cannot return to Town because the Leader has died.

```text
LEADER DEAD
     ↓
PARTY CONTINUES
     ↓
NO MANUAL RECALL
```

Mission failure occurs when:

```text
ALL ACTIVE HEROES IN THE PARTY
=
DEAD
```

or when another Floor-specific failure condition is triggered.

