# 11. NO SAFE FAILURE

Dungeon failure is not a safe state.

The following flow is forbidden:

```text
ENTER DUNGEON
     ↓
MISSION DIFFICULT
     ↓
MASTER CANCELS
     ↓
PARTY RETURNS SAFELY
```

The correct flow is:

```text
ENTER DUNGEON
     ↓
PARTY LOCK
     ↓
MISSION ACTIVE
     ↓
PARTY MUST CONTINUE
     │
     ├── VICTORY
     │      ↓
     │   PARTY SURVIVES
     │
     └── FAILURE
            ↓
        PARTY DIES
```

