# 71. PARTY UNLOCK

The Party does not unlock because the Master requests it.

The Party becomes eligible for post-mission processing only after:

```text
MISSION VICTORY
OR
MISSION FAILURE RESOLUTION
OR
VALID SYSTEM EXIT
```

Example after victory:

```text
MISSION ACTIVE
     ↓
PARTY LOCK = TRUE
     ↓
BOSS DEFEATED
     ↓
MISSION COMPLETE
     ↓
PARTY SESSION CLOSED
     ↓
PARTY LOCK = FALSE
```

Example after death:

```text
MISSION ACTIVE
     ↓
ALL HEROES DEAD
     ↓
PARTY DEFEATED
     ↓
DEATH RESOLUTION
     ↓
PARTY SESSION CLOSED
     ↓
HEROES REMAIN DEAD
```

`PARTY LOCK = FALSE` after death does not mean the Party returns safely to Town.

It only means the active Dungeon Session has ended.

```text
PARTY SESSION CLOSED
        ≠
PARTY RETURNED SAFELY
```

